<title>CANADA: MDC files $105 mln note offering.</title>
<headline>MDC files $105 mln note offering.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>MDC Communications Corp said Friday it had filed a preliminary prospectus for a proposed public offering of US$105 million senior subordinated notes, due 2006.</p>
<p>The prospectus was filed with the Ontario Securities Commission and a registration statement with the US Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>MDC said the net proceeds will be used to repay most of the company's outstanding debt.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
